    "overallZh": "熟练并不保证同一种较高用力动作在批量重复中始终保持相同负担。故事用“短休息后恢复、继续重复后又费力、再换工具”这一条线说明人与工具的互动可能改变工作负担与返工表现；但它不是医学结论，也不是控制实验。",
    "overall": "experience does not guarantee that the same forceful action will carry the same burden when it is repeated throughout a batch. The story follows one sequence—brief recovery after a break, renewed difficulty during continued repetition, then a change of tool—to show how person–tool interaction may affect workload and rework. It is neither a medical conclusion nor a controlled experiment.",
