    "overallZh": "第一版的问题不只是“字太多、图太细”。即使碰到没有文字的画面，站台乘客从中途加入时仍会遇到被页序切断的观看经验。齐羽先用连续蓝线回应不固定进入点，再根据第二次现场测试调整远距离细节与文字时机。",
    "overall": "The first version does not fail only because the text is too long or the images are too detailed. Even on a rooftop image with no text, a passenger entering midway encounters a viewing experience broken by page-by-page sequencing. Qi Yu first uses a continuous blue line to respond to unpredictable entry points, then uses the second station test to adjust distant detail and text timing.",
