        "Mo Lin shifts from watching the shoulder to listening to the tail of the bass → rehearsal results directly change what she attends to next.",
        "A Shen unexpectedly sustains the bass longer in the second full take and the other two delay in response → shared prediction and real-time mutual adjustment absorb an unplanned change.",
        "The final three parts still end at slightly different lengths → coordination is not mechanical synchrony."
