    "overall": "Ye Lin and Gao Yu face similar information, purposes, and risks before acting, and both choose two straps before either knows the result. What separates the outcomes is a threshold-cover fault that could not be seen beforehand and appears only under load. Gao Yu therefore takes on more repair and follow-up work in practice, while the damaged projector also changes how others look back on who is more reliable.",
