    "overall": "The ninety-minute Friday slot was long enough to finish either the signs or the connectors, so the connectors were a real and valuable alternative rather than a task that was never feasible. Choosing the signs was not a mistake, but it also meant giving up the chance to test physical connectors on Monday. Monday merely made visible an opportunity cost that had already arisen with Friday’s choice.",
    "overallZh": "周五九十分钟能完整切标牌，也能完整切连接件，因此连接件是真实而有价值的替代，而不是本来就做不完的次要任务。陈未选择标牌并非错误决定，但这一选择同时放弃了周一可进行的实物卡合确认；周一只是让周五已经产生的机会成本具体显现。",
