      "boundary": "Habitus is not fixed personality, a bad work habit, an explicit etiquette list, or an unchangeable fate, and not every skilled action should be called habitus. It refers to durable practical dispositions formed in a long-term social environment and expressed in relation to the cues and rewards of a particular field. The people and studio in this story are fictional.",
      "reflection": "Why can the same practical judgment Xu Lan brings from the wholesale market remain useful in one part of the new studio while another part has to change through repeated practice?"
