    "conceptName": "Archival silence",
    "conceptNameZh": "档案沉默",
    "explanationParagraphs": [
      "Archival silence can emerge gradually across record creation, administrative purpose, privacy decisions, selection for preservation, description, and later narration, leaving some experiences visible only in fragments.",
      "Indirect evidence and reading against the grain can clarify how a silence formed, but they cannot restore an absence into a complete and certain life. Unknowns and evidentiary limits should remain explicit in the final account."
    ],
    "explanationParagraphsZh": [
      "档案沉默会在记录产生、管理用途、隐私处置、选择保存、描述和后来叙述等环节逐渐形成，使某些经验只留下侧面痕迹。",
      "旁证和逆向阅读可以帮助理解沉默怎样形成，却不能把缺席恢复成完整、确定的人生。未知与证据边界仍应明确留在最终说明里。"
    ],
