    "overall": "This is not a single gap caused by the destruction of one crucial list. The teaching register was designed around learners and teachers; the expense ledger had no reason to maintain a stable name for unpaid childcare work; the children’s sign-in sheets served pickup and contact purposes and, even if preserved, may not have recorded a caregiver’s full name; the photographs later lost their original captions during accession. The retired learner’s name “Sister Xiaoqin” and the 18:55 and 21:10 key records expand what can be said, but still cannot establish that she came every day, define her status, or recover her complete name.",
    "overallZh": "这不是一张被销毁的关键名单造成的单点空缺。教学登记表本就只记录学员和教师，经费本不需要为无薪照看劳动留下稳定姓名，儿童签到主要服务接送与联系方式，即使未销毁也未必记录照看者全名；照片入藏时又失去原说明。退休学员的称呼和18:55、21:10钥匙记录能扩大可说范围，却仍不能确定“小琴姐”每天都来、她的身份或完整姓名。",
