    "fieldTitleZh": "会计与税务",
    "title": "The Twelve Thousand That Arrived",
    "titleZh": "到账的一万二",
    "summary": "The bonus pool must be confirmed before four o’clock, and Cen Ning’s course place expires at 16:15. A newly arrived equipment loan makes Luo Ning want to send the provisionally completed bonus sheet early.",
    "summaryZh": "四点前要确认奖金，16:15课程名额就到期；刚到账的设备贷款，让罗宁想把暂填的奖金表提前发出去。",
    "storyParagraphs": [
      "On Thursday morning, Luo Ning had to send the monthly bonus pool to the payroll agent before four o’clock. The studio accrued bonuses at 20% of the month’s operating profit, and before payment it also checked how much cash was in the bank. The bonus sheet already carried a provisional €2,400, but the operating books had not yet been closed. Just then, a €12,000 equipment loan arrived, and Luo Ning felt the payment-capacity check had effectively been cleared, so he wanted to send the sheet early. Glassworker Cen Ning was waiting for news: her place on a weekend professional course could be held only until 16:15, and without a confirmed bonus figure she could not decide whether to enroll.",
      "Xu Wen took the sheet but did not sign it. She placed the loan agreement beside the bank statement and entered two accounts on the same voucher: debit Cash €12,000 and credit Loan Payable €12,000, then posted both to the general ledger. When Luo Ning received the account details, the €12,000 bank inflow was already matched by an equal loan balance. The money could still be used for payments, but the bank statement alone could not confirm the bonus amount. He messaged Cen Ning and promised a final answer before four.",
      "At noon, the new kiln arrived under the contract, and the supplier collected €8,000. Xu Wen posted the invoice to the Equipment and Cash accounts: Equipment increased by €8,000 and Cash decreased by €8,000. Taken together, the two transactions left bank cash €4,000 higher, the studio with a new kiln worth €8,000, and a €12,000 loan liability still outstanding; looking only at these two transactions, equity had not increased.",
      "After the supplier left, Luo Ning pulled back the bonus sheet he had been about to send and returned the €2,400 to the pending-verification column. Cen Ning came back after lunch to ask again; the course had just sent a payment reminder, and she was worried that a transfer after four might be too late. Luo Ning reread the registration email with her. The deadline for submitting the payment receipt was still 16:15. He asked Xu Wen to call him as soon as the operating books were closed, put his phone beside the keyboard, and did not send the temporary sheet to the payroll agent.",
      "At 15:30, Xu Wen called Luo Ning over to the screen to review the two vouchers. The loan carried €12,000 on each side, and the kiln purchase €8,000 on each side; the corresponding accounts had been posted, and the contract and invoice were attached. Luo Ning multiplied the now-closed monthly operating profit by 20%, entered the result into the bonus pool, and then checked whether the bank balance could cover the payment. The new kiln was still standing in the middle of the studio, and the loan balance was still on the books. He signed this verified bonus sheet, not the morning’s provisional €2,400 reserve.",
      "Before four o’clock, Luo Ning sent the final bonus figure to the payroll agent and confirmed it with Cen Ning. She completed her course enrollment before 16:15. The draft bonus sheet still showed the crossed-out note “€2,400 provisional reserve,” the new kiln was already powered on, and the €4,000 net increase in bank cash created by the two transactions was still there."
    ],
    "storyParagraphsZh": [
      "周四上午，罗宁要在下午四点前把月度奖金池报给工资代理。工作室按当月经营利润的20%计提奖金，付款前还要核对银行里有多少钱。奖金表上已经暂列了2,400欧元，但经营账尚未关完；恰好12,000欧元设备贷款到账，罗宁觉得支付这一关已经过了，想把表先发出去。玻璃师岑宁在等消息，她周末专业课程的名额只能保留到16:15，迟迟拿不到奖金数字，就没法决定是否报名。",
      "许雯接过表，没有先签字。她把贷款合同夹到银行流水旁，在同一张凭证里填上两个账户：现金借方12,000，贷款应付款贷方12,000，再将它们分别过入总账。罗宁拿到账户明细时，入账的12,000旁边已有一笔等额贷款余额。那笔钱仍可用于付款，但他还不能凭这张流水确认奖金数额。他给岑宁回了消息，约好四点前给她最终答复。",
      "中午，新窑按合同送到，供应商收走8,000欧元。许雯把发票过账到设备和现金两个账户：设备增加8,000，现金减少8,000。两笔交易合在一起后，银行现金净增加4,000，工作室多了一台8,000欧元的新窑，同时仍有12,000欧元贷款负债；仅看这两笔，权益没有因此增加。",
      "供应商离开后，罗宁撤下准备发出的奖金表，把2,400重新留在待核实栏。午休后岑宁又来问了一次；课程那边刚发来付款提醒，她担心四点以后转账来不及。罗宁和她重看报名邮件，16:15前提交付款回执的时限还在。他请许雯关好经营账就先叫他，把电话放在键盘边，没有再把临时表交给工资代理。",
      "下午三点半，许雯叫罗宁到屏幕前核对两张凭证。贷款的借贷各为12,000，窑款的借贷各为8,000；对应账户已经过账，合同和发票也分别钉好。他把已关账的当月经营利润乘以20%，重新填进奖金池，再查银行余款能否支付。新窑还在工作室中央，贷款余额也仍在账上；他签下的是这张核对后的奖金表，而不是上午那张2,400的临时预留。",
      "四点前，罗宁把最终奖金数字发给工资代理，也给岑宁发了确认消息。她在16:15前完成了课程报名。奖金表的草稿还留着被划掉的“2,400预留”，新窑已经通电；银行账户里，由这两笔交易形成的4,000欧元净现金增加也仍然在。"
    ],
    "conceptName": "Double-entry bookkeeping",
    "conceptNameZh": "复式记账",
    "explanationParagraphs": [
      "Double-entry bookkeeping makes the same transaction affect at least two accounts and records equal debits and credits, preserving Assets = Liabilities + Equity. Debit and credit are account positions; they do not simply mean receipt, payment, plus, or minus.",
      "A €12,000 loan increases both cash and liabilities; an €8,000 kiln purchase increases equipment and reduces cash. Together, cash rises by €4,000, assets by €12,000, liabilities by €12,000, and equity is unchanged by these two transactions. A balanced entry still does not prove that the transaction is real."
    ],
    "explanationParagraphsZh": [
      "复式记账让同一交易至少影响两个账户，并以相等借方与贷方记录，使资产＝负债＋权益保持对应。借方、贷方是账户位置，不等于收款、付款或正负号。",
      "贷款12,000使现金与负债同增；买窑8,000使设备增加、现金减少。两笔合计现金净增4,000、资产净增12,000、负债增12,000，权益不因这两笔改变。平衡本身仍不保证交易真实。"
    ],
    "overall": "A loan receipt and an equipment purchase change cash, assets, and liabilities at the same time. Looking at the corresponding accounts together makes it possible to distinguish how much money is in the bank, how much the studio owes, and which changes come from operating performance.",
    "overallZh": "贷款到账、设备购入，会同时改变现金、资产和负债。把一项交易的对应账户一起看，才能分清银行里有多少钱、工作室欠多少钱，以及哪些变化来自经营成果。",
