      "boundary": "Accrual accounting does not replace cash budgeting, and these three items cannot determine whether the studio should permanently add fixed staff. Recognition still depends on the contract, acceptance, estimates, and applicable accounting rules, and receivables may still carry collection risk. The €2,500 here covers only the three listed items, while the €6,000 refers only to their June net cash inflow.",
      "reflection": "Before using an advance payment to promise future workdays, which completed services, outstanding obligations, incurred costs, and cash arrangements would you need to check separately?"
